    "methods_description": "EEG signals were recorded at 1000 Hz sampling rate from 20 participants performing tasks with visual, auditory, and combined multisensory stimuli. Participants provided self-reported vividness ratings for subjective perceptual assessment. Data validation included event-related potential (ERP) and power spectral density (PSD) analyses. The dataset comprises high-temporal-resolution neural activity recordings designed to investigate the integration of multiple sensory modalities and internal mental representations.",
